5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! Since we're five now, we really need a fair way to split the bills so nobody feels stressed about using the heater or lights, right?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. However, we need to be careful. We should analyze the actual yearly costs before deciding on a new system to avoid unexpected financial burdens.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want it to be fair, but it shouldn't be a huge chore! Who is going to do all the math every month? That sounds like a total drag.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be rational. If some of us are subsidizing others, it's a problem. I want to see if there's a real disparity in usage or if it's just gossip.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm less worried about the exact cents and more about the tension. We need a system that stops us from feeling like we're accusing each other every time a bill arrives.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly, Misaki! I don't want us to be scared of the thermostat. @Ryuji, what data do you think would help us find a balance between cost and comfort?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,We need to see the historical trends. The winter spikes are the biggest issue. I also want to know if changing the setup requires any upfront investment.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm curious about how other houses do it! Maybe they have a super easy trick that doesn't take hours of work. Let's find a shortcut!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Shortcuts often lead to inaccuracies, Rin. I'm interested in the actual room-by-room consumption. If the usage is wildly different, a flat split is simply illogical.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we should look at the payment history. I want to see where the friction has actually happened and how we've been handling the money so far.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried that if we get too technical, we'll just be staring at numbers instead of living. Let's look into how the rooms actually differ in heating needs!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Precision is necessary for fairness, but not at the cost of an expensive installation. We must weigh the cost of monitoring against the potential savings.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to check out a template! If we have a magic sheet where we just plug in numbers, maybe it won't be such a headache for the person doing it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,A template is just a tool; the data it processes is what matters. I'll be looking for evidence of usage gaps to see if a complex system is even justified.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Rin on the template, but for different reasons. A standardized process removes the personal element from the reminders, which should reduce the fighting.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see what we find! Let's make sure we choose something that lets us all relax in our rooms without doing mental math first.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the long-term financial patterns and the cost of any physical changes. Let's keep the discussion grounded in the actual numbers.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll look for the easiest way to do this! I don't want anyone spending their whole Sunday night acting like a human calculator.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll handle the analytical side. Let's see if the ""burden"" people are complaining about is a mathematical reality or just a feeling.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the history and the templates. I hope we can find a way to stop the reminders from feeling like attacks.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
